{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 14,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Greeting to Gaius"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The Elder,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To the beloved Gaius, whom I love in truth:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, I pray that you may prosper in all things and be in health, just as your soul prospers. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I rejoiced greatly when brethren came and testified of the truth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in you, just as you walk in the truth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU the truth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "truth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Gaius Commended for Generosity"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, you do faithfully whatever you do for the brethren "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU and especially for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and for strangers, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who have borne witness of your love before the church. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "If"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you send them forward on their journey in a manner worthy of God, you will do well, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "because they went forth for His name’s sake, taking nothing from the Gentiles. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We therefore ought to receive"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU support"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " such, that we may become fellow workers for the truth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Diotrephes and Demetrius"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I wrote to the church, but Diotrephes, who loves to have the preeminence among them, does not receive us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, if I come, I will call to mind his deeds which he does, prating"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "talking nonsense"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " against us with malicious words. And not content with that, he himself does not receive the brethren, and forbids those who wish to, putting "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " out of the church."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good. He who does good is of God, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but he who does evil has not seen God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Demetrius has a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "good"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " testimony from all, and from the truth itself. And we also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "testify"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bear witness, and you know that our testimony is true."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Farewell Greeting"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I had many things to write, but I do not wish to write to you with pen and ink; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but I hope to see you shortly, and we shall speak face to face."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Peace to you. Our friends greet you. Greet the friends by name."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}